ry_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"lmcrVOvJUydTmnZIAIZlAg","review_id":"UWA8AvRIZjuhMYM2qm8-Yw","date":"2017-02-15T19:40:29","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9439346790313721,"text_excerpt":"The halal guys is one of the newest food spots downtown. They have sandwiches or the platter. I always get the combo platter because I'm greedy! They give a lot of food for what you pay. The gyro and chicken taste real good. Just make sure to get the white sauce and just a dab of the red sauce or none of the red if you can't handle spice. Just don't ask for extra red sauce, you're going to regret it, I guarantee it! Great service cheap prices and pretty decent food for 9-10 bucks. The only thing that I think is lacking is variety but then again it's based on the food truck in NYC so I guess that's ok."},{"business_id":"lmcrVOvJUydTmnZIAIZlAg","review_id":"4qIbQJzN6uSjB-VWjPj4rg","date":"2016-08-01T16:52:25","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9283618330955505,"text_excerpt":"The Halal Guys is a simple place that is simply good. Having eating at the original food carts in NYC, the New Orleans location may take the food indoors but the flavors stay the same. I can't get enough of the combo plate topped with plenty white sauce and some red sauce to add some zing to the plate. The place is quick and easy, just wished they had easier parking around the place because I would be some home for dinner more often."},{"business_id":"lmcrVOvJUydTmnZIAIZlAg","review_id":"qJeXcP0ygZqcw_ySHCiT0g","date":"2016-07-02T15:50:28","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9278980493545532,"text_excerpt":"So excited to have this place here in New Orleans! First time I had it, was of course in the famous NYC of the famous food carts. 53rd and 6th to be exact--no where else! You pretty much had to have it every night you were there, haha. Walking into New Orleans's The Halal Guys (it's a very casual restaurant-y place-not food cart), everyone was super friendly and excited to serve us. Small combo platter (gyro and chicken) was about $8 and regular sized platter was like $9 I think. Regular combo platter is the way to go. And of course EXTRA EXTRA white sauce. You seriously can't have too much of that white sauce. Soooo good. Oh--and the hot sauce. If you like spicy, you need it in your life..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"lmcrVOvJUydTmnZIAIZlAg","photo_id":"22wraDvygKtJ864HWSnOtg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/22wraDvygKtJ864HWSnOtg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8814499974250793},{"business_id":"lmcrVOvJUydTmnZIAIZlAg","photo_id":"rWkFjVOXQM9QxD0Pzse9gQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/rWkFjVOXQM9QxD0Pzse9gQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8773585557937622},{"business_id":"lmcrVOvJUydTmnZIAIZlAg","photo_id":"wGdMav3_thuLRV7H5s_Fpg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/wGdMav3_thuLRV7H5s_Fpg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8462737798690796},{"business_id":"lmcrVOvJUydTmnZIAIZlAg","photo_id":"1tRreIj86GjMtNN2wMMuLA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/1tRreIj86GjMtNN2wMMuLA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8383603096008301},{"business_id":"lmcrVOvJUydTmnZIAIZlAg","photo_id":"TYkd_9bZe9aC4n_0LGkkrg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/TYkd_9bZe9aC4n_0LGkkrg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8327603340148926}]},"notebook_